@startuml
title Feature 002 - Read, Quiz and Manual Writeback (DRAFT)
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox
actor Teacher
participant "Teacher Browser" as TB
participant "Authorization" as Auth
participant "Activity / Quiz\nOrdered Processing" as Quiz
participant "Guided Notes /\nWriteback Coordinator" as Notes
database "Runtime Store" as Store
participant "Sheets Access\nBackend Service Account" as Access
participant "Original Google Sheet" as Google
participant "Students / Role Sync" as Students

group US1 - preparation, no Google user login
  Teacher -> TB : password login; set groups; paste Sheets URL
  TB -> Auth : read source (teacher identity)
  Auth -> Notes : authorized preparation
  Notes -> Store : acquire preparation lock
  alt group count missing or invalid
    Notes --> TB : require valid group count; do not read or retain source
  else group count valid
  Notes -> Access : read source from validated URL identity
  Access -> Google : read all supported GRID sheets, including hidden
  Google --> Access : sheet identities / cells / merges / structure\navailable permission information (no test writes)
  Access --> Notes : source data or access error
  Notes -> Notes : whole-cell literal Q1..QN, unique / contiguous\nreject marker cells with partial-character formatting\nrecord dynamic locations; list excluded sheets
  alt known non-editable source or answer cell
    Notes --> TB : fix sharing / protected ranges; no activity commit
  else all valid and groups ready
    Notes -> Store : atomically commit source + locations + Q1 WAITING
    Notes --> TB : source / question count / prepared
    opt write permission cannot be confirmed without modification
      Notes --> TB : write permission not confirmed (teacher warning)\nread success is NOT a write guarantee
    end
  else read or validation failure
    Notes --> TB : safe reason / location; no partial activity
  end
  end
  Notes -> Store : release preparation lock
end

group US2 - existing quiz, independent of cloud waiting
  TB -> Auth : manual start
  Auth -> Quiz : validate teacher / activity / question
  Quiz -> Store : WAITING -> ANSWERING
  Quiz -> Students : authorized phase snapshots
  Students -> Auth : student answer
  Auth -> Quiz : validated binding
  Quiz -> Store : same ordered boundary: accept once / assign rank
  Quiz -> TB : live teacher record
  Quiz -> Students : submitting identity only; no observer event
  TB -> Auth : manual close
  Auth -> Quiz : validated teacher
  Quiz -> Store : same order as submit; freeze accepted results
  Quiz -> Students : publish; RESULTS or final COMPLETED
  opt non-final Next
    TB -> Auth : next (teacher / activity / current question)
    Auth -> Quiz : validated next -> WAITING, manual Start required
  end
end

group US3/US4 - manual writeback, any prepared phase
  Teacher -> TB : New writeback OR explicit reconcile of original operation
  TB -> Auth : writeback(activityId) OR reconcile(activityId, operationId)
  Auth -> Notes : validate teacher and bound source
  Notes -> Store : acquire per-activity operation boundary
  alt another operation running
    Notes --> TB : busy; no parallel write
  else new writeback while pending barrier exists
    Notes --> TB : WRITEBACK_PENDING + original operationId\nno worker / no implicit reconcile
  else reconcile request is not for an eligible original operation
    Notes --> TB : WRITEBACK_NOT_PENDING / stale or invalid operation
  else accepted request; acquire running ownership
  alt explicit reconcile of pending or conflict with unresolved attempt
    Store --> Notes : restore ORIGINAL snapshot / targets / expected text\nnever capture newly closed winners
  else new writeback without pending barrier
    Notes -> Store : capture immutable closed minimum-rank winners
    Store --> Notes : snapshot + source + locations + verified evidence
  end
  alt original snapshot has no fills
    Notes -> Store : NO_CHANGES; running=false; no Google I/O
    Notes --> TB : no eligible closed answers
  else original snapshot has fills
  Notes -> Store : load this activity's WritebackEvidence / pending records
  Notes -> Access : preflight/reconcile targets and structure\nusing imported mapping + evidence + original operation
  Access -> Google : read original source / targets
  Google --> Access : current values / types / identities / structure
  Access --> Notes : target verification data or read error
  Notes -> Notes : recorded expected answers may replace original markers\nnot missing placeholders; unexplained changes still conflict\nnew partial-character formatting in answer cells is a conflict
  alt detected conflict or untrusted mapping
    Notes -> Store : CONFLICT; stop all unsent updates\nretain unresolvedAttempt if earlier outcome unknown
    Notes --> TB : conflict locations; no forced overwrite
  else read cannot establish outcome
    Notes -> Store : PENDING_VERIFICATION if possibly sent; otherwise FAILED
    Notes --> TB : pending verification or safe read error
  else preflight valid
    Notes -> Notes : original markers eligible; verified prior text skipped\npending exact expected text reconciled; other values conflict
    note over Notes,Google
      A-04: external editors must not modify targets/structure during activity.
      Preflight and write are NOT a remote lock or atomic comparison.
      Plan must validate protection feasibility; no absolute concurrent-edit guarantee.
    end note
    alt old remote outcome unknown AND uncompleted original markers remain
      Notes -> Store : retain PENDING_VERIFICATION + unresolvedAttempt barrier
      Notes --> TB : read-only reconciliation; NO second write\nverified expected text is not an uncompleted marker\nlocal settle / 180s / 200s are not remote termination proof
    else eligible markers remain AND old attempts safe / no earlier attempt
    opt eligible original markers remain AND all preflight checks pass
      Notes -> Access : write only eligible original cells as literal text
      Access -> Google : update target VALUES only
      alt definitely rejected / not sent
        Google --> Access : safe failure
        Access --> Notes : known failure
        Notes -> Store : FAILED; running=false; no unresolved attempt\nreturn without verification GET; quiz data unchanged
      else possibly sent / reply lost
        Access --> Notes : outcome unknown
        Notes -> Store : retain original operation as pending verification
      else remote response received
        Google --> Access : applied response
        Access --> Notes : request completed, not yet verified success
      end
      opt result APPLIED or UNKNOWN (not NOT_SENT / KNOWN_REJECTED)
        Notes -> Access : read back original targets when possible
        Access -> Google : verify exact values / types / mapping
        Google --> Access : values or error
        Access --> Notes : per-target verification results
        Notes -> Store : verified evidence / pending / conflict\nSUCCEEDED only when all verified AND local transport settled
        Notes --> TB : per-target outcome; never partial as whole success
      end
    end
    else no remaining eligible markers; all snapshot targets verified
      Notes -> Store : content synchronized; no write needed\nnew operation allowed only after local transport settles
    end
  end
  end
  Notes -> Store : release running ownership only after local transport settles\nretain barrier for unresolved remote writes with remaining markers
  note over Notes,Store
    No cloud action mutates quiz phase, answers or rank.
    Pending is reconciled before a new snapshot is allowed.
    No blind retry, background write, automatic restore or whole-sheet rollback.
    FAILED with no barrier: repair access, then explicit NEW operation.
    CONFLICT with unresolvedAttempt / PENDING: reconcile ORIGINAL only.
    Status GET / browser refresh reads local state only; never auto-reconciles.
    Restart may clear local operation; remote values remain.
  end note
  end
end
legend bottom
  Logical design; final implementation consistency review: 2026-11-19.
  Q1..QN dynamic; six questions / three groups are demonstration data.
  DA-T058-01: protected live test remains FAIL (MISSING / UNKNOWN).
  Generic access errors do not prove protected-range denial.
  Live exactly-once / timeout / pending reconcile evidence is not claimed.
  Prior Specify / cross-group confirmation retained: 2026-11-18.
  Clarify integrated version approved by user: 2026-11-18.
endlegend
@enduml
